# Public repository roots are opt-in. Update public-files.json alongside this list.
/*
!/.editorconfig
!/.gitignore
!/.prettierignore
!/.prettierrc.json
!/README.md
!/eslint.config.mjs
!/package.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/pnpm-workspace.yaml
!/tsconfig.json
!/public-files.json
!/src/
!/docs/
!/scripts/

# Only reviewed public documents and tooling are eligible.
/docs/*
!/docs/PUBLISHING.md
!/docs/00-governance/
/docs/00-governance/*
!/docs/00-governance/*-RULES.md
!/docs/research/
!/docs/deployments/
/docs/research/*
!/docs/research/README.md
!/docs/research/architecture.md
!/docs/research/capabilities.md
!/docs/research/implementation.md
/docs/deployments/*
!/docs/deployments/openshell-dsh.md
/scripts/*
!/scripts/check-publication.py

# Private evidence and deployment material stay local, byte-identical.
/validation/
/docs/research/archive/
/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
/docs/DSH-OPENSHELL-V0.1.md

# Secrets, IDE state and generated runtime material are never public inputs.
**/.idea/
**/node_modules/
**/runtime/
**/cache/
**/.cache/
**/_logs/
**/.npmrc
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/DRAFT.md
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/.DS_Store
/dist/
/coverage/
